00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:16.590
We’re on break!

00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:17.830
Let’s go to a resort!

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:20.460
Time to heal our fatigue
from work, meow!

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:23.860
<i>Gah!</i>

00:23:23.860 --> 00:23:25.130
We saw nothing.

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:28.950
Let’s forget the brat boy and Pikachu,
and enjoy our break!

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:29.900
Yeah!

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:30.510
